   # Or inline #[cfg(test)] mod tests {}\ntests/\n└── integration.rs     # Integration tests\nbenches/\n└── benchmark.rs       # Criterion benchmarks\n```\n\n---\n\n**TIP**: Use `rstest` for parameterized tests and `proptest` for property-based testing."
