ackend follows Codex, Frontend follows Antigravity\n4. External models have **zero filesystem write access**\n5. **SESSION_ID Handoff** – Plan must include `CODEX_SESSION` / `ANTIGRAVITY_SESSION` at end (for `/ccg:execute resume <SESSION_ID>` use)"
